      "paperId": "fb12c70784defd81ff9a710e5378ba5f7aa6e76e",
      "title": "Prophetic Politics and Tyranny: A Reassessment of Rosenzweig\u2019s The Star of Redemption",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "R. Rashkover",
          "authorId": "113405739"
